  `FelixKa` (postmarketOS).
- `firmware/fetch-tas5782m-tuning.sh` and `firmware/tas5782m-dsp-fw.py` extract
  the speaker DSP register table from Lenovo's published GPLv2 kernel release
  (`lenovo_cd-18781y_cd-18781y.201218.2018_opensource.tgz`).
